        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "00b7366e-7006-5cfc-83e3-618ce30ee2c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S.P. Venkatesh\n- Songs: \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\", \"Style\"\n- Films: \"Gentleman\", \"Punjabi House\", \"Chup Chup Ke\", \"Khatta Meetha\"\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer\n\nFacts:\n- \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" is a Tamil song featured in the 1993 Tamil film \"Gentleman\".\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer whose notable songs include \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\" and \"Style\".\n- In 1998, Suresh Peters and S.P. Venkatesh composed the music for the Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\"; Suresh Peters composed the songs in his debut as a film composer, and S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.\n- \"Chup Chup Ke\" was originally titled \"Khatta Meetha\", and its story was adapted from the 1998 Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
